## Scope note

The MIT licence above covers the source code of NumeroVastu 360.

The **knowledge pack content** under `knowledge-pack/` — numerology and Vastu
interpretation text, remedy kits, deity mappings, Dasha period signatures and
their English/Hindi/Gujarati localisations — is traditional and editorial
material authored for this project. It is distributed under the same MIT terms
so practitioners can review, fork and localise it, on the understanding that it
is **traditional guidance, not medical, legal, financial or psychological
advice**.

Third-party reference data is credited in the file headers where it is used.
In particular `astro.js` is a self-contained port of algorithms from Jean
Meeus, *Astronomical Algorithms* (2nd ed., 1998), with coefficient tables taken
from the MIT-licensed `astronomia` port of the same book (Meeus tables are
public reference data). Those portions remain under their original MIT terms.
